      "doneWhen": "A dependsOn containing a non-string, an implements given as a bare string, and decision/0030's array-shaped supersedes each produce exactly one shape: error and no crash; a testsConclusion with a null testsRun, and a ledgerConclusion with a null ledgerRun, are each a run: error (this clause originally read \"a mainConclusion with a null mainRunUrl is a pr: error\"; item/ledger-main-push-record deleted both of those fields from PullRequest and moved the fact into Run.merges, so the clause is restated against the fields that inherited its intent rather than dropped -- checkMergeEntry() validates each field independently today, so an entry may claim a conclusion with no run to point at); the live ledger validates clean once decision/0030 is corrected; the rule has a mutations.json entry.",
