      "doneWhen": "Token page test; abilities outside the eight are rejected; the plaintext token never appears in a later render. The clause is well defined: spec section 11 names exactly the eight abilities it refers to (directories:read/write, files:read/write/delete, properties:read/write, search).\n\nThe BLOCKED paragraph that stood here until 2026-09-19 is REMOVED rather than annotated, because it did not describe a limit -- it described a mechanism that was false when written and is quoted in full inside decision/0093 so the correction is not lost with it. laravel/sanctum v4.3.3 is in composer.json and composer.lock, installed and discovered in CI on PR #259.\n\nCOMPLETED 2026-09-19 across two PRs, and the split is the point. #259 carried the page, the enum, the model guard and the tests; #262 carried the container smoke. The item was NOT marked Completed when #259 merged, although all three written clauses were satisfied and mutation-proven by then, because CLAUDE.md's \"a UI item is not done until the container smoke drives it\" is a fourth clause this item's text never spelled out. grep -c api-tokens .github/scripts/container-smoke.mjs returned 0 at that point. Counting the item done on the strength of the clauses that WERE met is the substitution decision/0087 was written against.\n\nEvidence, each half observed rather than inferred from the other: the ability guard is load-bearing per the guards job (\"All 89 guard(s) are load-bearing\", the registry having gone 88 -> 89 with the added id being exactly personal-access-token-abilities-restricted-to-eight); the smoke's reload assertion is load-bearing per mutation/0031, which left creation working and failed only at the reload. A migration was needed and is included: Sanctum v4.3.3 does not auto-load one -- its provider carries only publishesMigrations() and loadMigrationsFrom appears zero times, read from the pinned source rather than recalled -- and Sanctum::ignoreMigrations() does not exist in v4 either, so it was not added.",
      "actionStatus": "CompletedActionStatus",
      "startTime": "2026-09-19T09:05:00Z",
      "endTime": "2026-09-19T09:47:30Z",
      "result": [
