      "doneWhen": "A test greps every env() key read under app/, config/ and docker/ and asserts each appears in the configuration reference; every listed page exists and is non-trivial.\n\nThe dependsOn edge to item/api-presigned-upload was REMOVED on 2026-09-19 by decision/0094: spec section 12 splits documentation by audience and the self-hoster page list contains no API page, so the edge expressed writing order and was being enforced as necessity. This item is startable independently of the API chain.",
