      ],
      "doneWhen": "Both smoke sites that report a destination -- the installer helper's waitForURL and checkAdminUsersPage()'s status check -- report where the browser actually LANDED, through one shared helper, naming a verification bounce explicitly when the landing place is the notice; checkFirstAdminIsVerified() is removed as unprovable; and the new message is itself shown by mutation rather than asserted.",
      "actionStatus": "CompletedActionStatus",
      "startTime": "2026-09-18T19:38:00Z",
