      "check": "container-smoke.mjs checkAdminPeriodsPage() -- the image job failed at the named assertion \"2020-01 was not archived after closePeriod() through the real form\", dumping \"closing 2020-01 through /admin/periods never archived it -- raw output: ARCHIVED:no\". Reached, not timed out on the way: the log shows the check created the scratch 2020-01 file through tinker, opened /admin/periods, found the close-period form, filled both fields and submitted, and got past checkAdminRolesPage and every check before it. Only the database failed to move. The other twelve checks on the same run all passed -- guards, lint, build assets, composer audit, dependency review, validate ledger and all six test matrix jobs -- which is the other half: AdminPeriodsTest calls closePeriod() directly through Livewire's test harness and cannot see a form that no longer reaches the component. Run https://github.com/turbophp/doccum/actions/runs/35332670342.",
